{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52896","headline":"背道逐教偈 · 本净","name":"背道逐教偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道体本无修，不修自合道。\n若起修道心，此人未（《景德传灯录》作「不」）会道。\n弃却一真性，却入闹浩浩。\n忽逢修道人，第一莫向道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"本净","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}